OL,3,GNEWSACompetitor killed in Manx Grand
OL,4,APrix crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rider who died in a crash during
OL,7,Fqualifying for the Manx Grand Prix
OL,8,Fraces has been named.
OL,10,FMauro Poncini, from Caslano in
OL,11,FSwitzerland, was involved in the crash
OL,12,Fon the opening lap of Tuesday's
OL,13,Fqualifying session. The 29-year-old was
OL,14,Fa newcomer at the Manx Grand Prix but
OL,15,Fhad previously competed at the North
OL,16,FWest 200 in Northern Ireland.
OL,18,FThe incident, which involved two
OL,19,Friders, took place at Cruickshanks in
OL,20,FRamsey at about 18:50 BST.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
