OL,3,GNEWSACompetitor killed in Manx Grand
OL,4,APrix crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FRace organisers said: "The Manx Grand
OL,7,FPrix Races pass on their deepest
OL,8,Fsympathy to his father Florio, mother
OL,9,FManuela, sister Marzia and girlfriend
OL,10,FSharon, as well as his family and
OL,11,Ffriends."
